    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0940" n="903" sameAs="frus:frus1951-54IranEd2/pg903"/>

                <head>358. Despatch From the Embassy in Iran to the Department of State<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d358-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <idno type="document-identifier">No. 410</idno>
                    </seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                    <placeName>Tehran</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1954-01-11"
                        >January 11, 1954</date>.</dateline>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Conversation with Prime Minister 
                            Zahedi
                    </item>
                </list>
                <p>I have the honor to enclose herewith a memorandum of a conversation regarding the
                    Qashqai tribes which took place on January 7, <pb facs="0941" n="904"
                        xml:id="pg904"/> 1954, between General Fazlollah
                        Zahedi, Prime Minister of Iran, and myself.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    <hi rendition="#bold">
                        Loy W. Henderson
                    </hi>
                </p>


                <xi:include href="d358-a1.xml" xpointer="d358-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d358-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d358-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files
                    1950–1954, 788.00/1–1154. Secret. Drafted by Henderson. Received January 23. A copy was sent to London.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
